{"posts":[{"id":"eurotrash_p1_1","t":"Hi guys and girls.\n\nHaving read some of the other's journals I recognised the same problems as I am having. Lack of disciplin, exiting early on good setups, not waiting for setups to be mature to get in and getting into trouble because of it.\n\nI'm hoping that the peer pressure on here will force my hand into analysing the market correctly and not inventing setups and when I do get a good setup I need to make the most of it.\n\nThanks to IF and everuone else for their support.\n\nEurotrash","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#1","p":1,"im":[],"m":1},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_2","t":"You're in good place mate, just be patient and disciplined.","a":"Castus","d":"","n":"#2","p":1,"im":[],"m":2},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_3","t":"Thanks Castus,\n\nI don't have much time during the week, will be doing loads of homework over the weekend.","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#3","p":1,"im":[],"m":3},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_4","t":"Been looking at the QM trades, this one stuck out nicely.\n\nH4 at supply\n\nM15 lower TF supply\n\nM1 shows consolidation area engulfed, offers perfect entry at previous descion area","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#4","p":1,"im":["c573fbe6a0eebd1b52d752b5488ac9a31d530915","0d679e2c6bd381eaceffaba1b9d22c49e2454fe3","9ffc762d07ac255ae694992575662d8f252bd796"],"m":4},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_5","t":"This a trade that setup earlier this week, tried to post first pic, but for some reson didn't work. I moved my stop to BE to early and got bumped out BE. At least would appear I read the market correctly, but handled it wrong.\n\nBefrore\n\nafter","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#5","p":1,"im":["37f640803acbe4cd274b6110e654d5be8d8cb56c","8c3082c0faa2893285cce4ba5352bd72b5b9ec47"],"m":5},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_6","t":"Hi Eurotrash,\n\nThe good news is that you did not lose any money!\n\nBy looking at your 30 min chart, I see that you moved your stop while price was at demand DP. Don't forget that demand remains demand until it becmes S and vice versa for Supply. In this case, there was some demand left and pice shot back up. Maybe waiting for a break and close bellow the level could help you see if the demand has been totally removed or not.\n\nAnyway, wish you all the best in your trading, Mel","a":"@mel","d":"","n":"#6","p":1,"im":[],"m":6},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_7","t":"Thanks Mel, appreciate the comments.\n\nI'm now looking at Euro GBP to short it.","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#7","p":1,"im":["c73e0ed5bf4ff18584e5cfa0948a711de0faa5b2"],"m":7},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_8","t":"Price has arrived at Euor GBP level at the same time as Euro has arrived at this massive Daily price cap, need to be careful here.","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#8","p":1,"im":["2545fb833699ebbde3e19e3ae5aa7843352b85be"],"m":8},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_9","t":"A quick look back at the price cap on eu","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#9","p":1,"im":["2a4d2a421bd23aa93afe7c3075d9ceb40017674f"],"m":9},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_10","t":"We are now in the right supply zone for a sell, a QM has possibly setup\n\nThere is also compression leading up to it with demand pockets being taken out","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#10","p":1,"im":["bc531cc23520d5697fc54f3f3e3a6f50eb37be26","614c423cc031839b75648b02d0276ef9a1fd4975"],"m":10},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_11","t":"Eu wrapped up with a small gain, only just 1:1 RR when both entries are combined","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#11","p":1,"im":["685666b53869ae0399d8dd05ed7cd13f2d6d2cbb"],"m":11},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_12","t":"EJ is arriving at a nice area\n\nLooking at the weekly, we are at the top of a supply zone\n\nLooking back at the H1 we can see that we hit the supply zone perfectly (pink line is today's high so far.\n\nCurrent PA is really choppy need some confirmation","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#12","p":1,"im":["fd5d513ec1a1334a16056d975b51d3bb0d1d6b01","a72c3b456b2f869be3446532f7d61a97ceb0e83a","64aeecc4f805654830390709d96a7f53bb5fd9b4"],"m":12},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_13","t":"Another pair worth having on the radar, nice daily demand zone\n\nM5 is compressing into supply, so we may re visit bottom of the daily supply.","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#13","p":1,"im":["87d0f1f21034aa215a925f747e4b17f7c2123ab6","25559591b64aebc7d3dfa15dd977a773eff9adca"],"m":13},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_14","t":"A nice short term short on GBP CHF","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#14","p":1,"im":["1b3321e99fd1f18f3bf45fc2c23118b73077a100","25559591b64aebc7d3dfa15dd977a773eff9adca"],"m":14},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_15","t":"And the one that got away","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#15","p":1,"im":["9b0be273753fd6c4be25d074db8a725f92cf135f"],"m":15},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_16","t":"Looking at gold","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#16","p":1,"im":["c9b8909491222a1fe0ef540bda09d2edb0b313a5","f5ccd9cb7f18f6b438b83bdc6d8e4de1ddf23749"],"m":16},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_17","t":"GBP CHF seems stuck in a rut. sold gold","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#17","p":1,"im":["2ffcb59c0d3686bcfbc7062a8a4ab4f9b529fd46"],"m":17},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_18","t":"GB CHF took off after all","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#18","p":1,"im":["3897e4b8607c45380586532f06d21a8bbc4bc5a6"],"m":18},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_19","t":"ej worth a look","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#19","p":1,"im":["02c79120fdbdcd2ab0e4eb993e5afb69f980d05e"],"m":19},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_20","t":"Edit:taken half profit on gold, ej; gb chf, letting rest roll\n\nej was worth a look","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#20","p":1,"im":["d2890d86439dc7ece9efd29c795e0def0a8b589e"],"m":20},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_21","t":"glad I took half off gold","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#21","p":1,"im":["6b8823044acb049fcc10c8aaafd36cfd22185981"],"m":21},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_22","t":"glad I took half off gold","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#22","p":1,"im":["6b8823044acb049fcc10c8aaafd36cfd22185981"],"m":22},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_23","t":"another gold trader...nice","a":"FX.Sniffer","d":"","n":"#23","p":1,"im":[],"m":23},{"id":"eurotrash_p1_24","t":"This is really confident work. I'm delighted","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#24","p":1,"im":[],"m":24},{"id